("MSPAM",[],"brand_std","easy","A Hampton guest isn't happy with their stay. What does the 100% Hampton Guarantee tell team members to do?","Un huésped de Hampton no está contento. ¿Qué dice la Garantía 100% Hampton?",["Make it right — any team member can help improve the stay","Send them to corporate","Only the GM can listen","Nothing unless they paid cash"],["Arreglarlo: cualquier miembro del equipo puede mejorar la estancia","Mandarlo a corporativo","Solo el gerente escucha","Nada salvo si pagó en efectivo"],"Hampton: 'talk to any member of our team and we'll Make It Right. Guaranteed.' Follow your GM's guarantee procedure for refunds.","Hampton: 'habla con cualquiera del equipo y lo arreglaremos'. Sigue el procedimiento del gerente para reembolsos.",HB),
